      "title": "PROMPT (feeds every stage)",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.35.2",
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description:\nA cinematic, ten-beat slice-of-life sequence featuring a young East Asian woman with long dark hair, framed in 16:9. Beat 1 (0–1s): an establishing portrait shot that mirrors the reference composition — she stands on a sunlit campus path wearing a soft pink knit sweater with a small dark horse logo on the chest, white wired earbuds trailing from her ears, gentle morning sunlight filtering through tall trees with whitewashed trunks behind her, a softly blurred white academic building in the distant background, dappled light playing across her hair. Beat 2 (1–2s): a light breeze catches her hair, strands drifting across her cheek; she slowly turns her gaze from off-camera toward the lens, her expression shifting from distant thought to a soft, aware half-smile. Beat 3 (2–3s): a smooth dolly-tracks backward as she begins to walk forward along the path, the camera keeping her centered, footsteps unseen but felt in the rhythm. Beat 4 (3–4s): a low-angle tracking pass under the tree canopy, sunlight strobing across the lens as leaves pass overhead, the pink sweater glowing warm against the deep green bokeh. Beat 5 (4–5s): a medium shot at her shoulder level, her hand drifting up to touch one earbud, adjusting it slightly, eyes lifted toward the distant building as if listening to something meaningful. Beat 6 (5–6s): rack focus from her face to the white campus building behind her, then back to her eyes, the shallow depth-of-field revealing hints of other students walking in soft focus far behind. Beat 7 (6–7s): a close-up of the small dark horse logo on her sweater catching a single warm sunbeam, fabric texture in sharp relief, shallow depth of field. Beat 8 (7–8s): a slow-motion insert — her hair drifting in the breeze, individual strands backlit by golden hour-style sunlight filtering through the leaves. Beat 9 (8–9s): back to medium shot, she laughs gently at something off-screen, her smile widening into a natural, unposed grin, eyes crinkling. Beat 10 (9–10s): a final long shot from behind as she walks away down the long tree-lined avenue, the white building straight ahead, her silhouette growing smaller, pink sweater still visible against the green-and-amber palette, the camera holding still as she disappears softly into the bokeh. Photorealistic, soft natural daylight, shallow depth of field, warm pastel color grading, gentle film grain, 1152x640 resolution.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft ambient campus atmosphere: distant bird chirps, gentle rustling of leaves in a light breeze. Faint distant chatter from other students, muffled and indistinct. The soft crunch of sneakers on gravel as she walks. Subtle traffic hum from far beyond the campus. A distant school bell ringing faintly at beat 6. The faint rustle of her sweater fabric as she adjusts her earbud.\n\nnon_digetic_music:\nA gentle, uplifting acoustic piece in a major key: soft fingerpicked acoustic guitar opens at beat 1, joined by a warm piano melody at beat 3 (as she begins walking), and a subtle, airy string pad that swells gently across beats 5–8 (the listening and smiling section). A single bell-tone accent at beat 9 as she laughs, and a soft, sustained piano chord with reverb tail carries through beat 10 as the camera holds on her retreating figure. Intimate, nostalgic, slice-of-life, no percussion, no vocals."
      ],
